Testing my build against 2022.02-rc2 and qmake fails to build our Qt project:
Project ERROR: Unknown module(s) in QT: webkit

Digging into it a bit, the updated qt5webkit package appears to be installing
the mkspecs into the target instead of the host.  Also the mkspecs have
hardcoded library and include paths instead of using $$QT_MODULE_INCLUDE_BASE
etc like the other Qt packages

